OL,3,GNEWSAAlcoholic former GP saved by
OL,4,ASalvation Army
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said, despite understanding "an
OL,7,Fawful lot" about addiction he still
OL,8,Fkept relapsing, but at Gloucester House
OL,9,Fhe "found faith" and was able to tackle
OL,10,Fthe 12-step recovery programme.
